Third-party and brand assets in flasher.lhtx.org
================================================

The MIT license in LICENSE covers the source code of this project. The files
below are third-party or brand assets and are NOT covered by that grant.

1. Liberty Hill Mesh brand assets
   ------------------------------
       public/favicon.svg
       the inline mark and wordmark in public/index.html

   (c) Liberty Hill Mesh, CC-BY-SA-4.0, the same mark the lhtx.org site uses.
   These identify the Liberty Hill Mesh network specifically. If you adapt
   this project for your own mesh, replace them with your own.

2. Bricolage Grotesque
   -------------------
       public/fonts/bricolage-grotesque-latin.woff2
       public/fonts/bricolage-grotesque-latin-ext.woff2

   Bricolage Grotesque by Mathieu Triay, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
   https://github.com/ateliertriay/bricolage
   The latin and latin-ext variable subsets as built by Google Fonts,
   served from this origin because the Content-Security-Policy in
   public/_headers allows styles and fonts from 'self' only.

