6. Board catalogue
   ---------------
       public/boards.json

   The board list is flasher.meshcore.io's config.json (MIT, same author),
   fetched live by the Worker. This file is the offline fallback, derived
   from the same source by scripts/sync-boards.mjs; the commit is recorded
   in it.

